2026-10-13T13:03:14.8530670Z       ✓ Super Admin can manage any user and any lab (1 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8531718Z       ✓ Lab Manager can manage subordinate in own lab, but not in another lab (1 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8532782Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot manage peer manager or project manager
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8534125Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot elevate technician to manager role
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8535130Z       ✓ Self-role change is rejected with SELF_MANAGEMENT_FORBIDDEN (1 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8536510Z       ✓ Inactive actor is denied with ACTOR_INACTIVE
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8537410Z     2. Project-to-Lab Canonical Membership Resolver (projectMembershipService)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8538361Z       ✓ resolveProjectLabs correctly identifies owner and servicing laboratories (2 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8539180Z       ✓ getDiscrepancyReport scans database and returns audit report without data loss (3 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8539999Z       ✓ canManageProject allows owner lab manager and super admin; denies non-owner manager
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8540666Z     3. Assignable Roles Server Catalogue (GET /api/access/assignable-roles)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8541271Z       ✓ Super Admin gets all 10 roles in assignableRoles (7 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8542046Z       ✓ Lab Manager gets only ALLOWED_SUB_ROLES and sees peer/admin roles as unmanageable with reasons (6 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8542851Z       ✓ Ordinary viewer is denied access to assignable-roles (403 Forbidden) (9 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8543492Z       ✓ GET /api/access/capabilities returns platform role capabilities (6 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8544017Z     4. Work Assignment Eligibility & Validation (A23, LG-17, A33)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8544670Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to deactivated technician is rejected with ASSIGNEE_INACTIVE (400) (12 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8545366Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to technician in different lab is rejected with 403 (7 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8546231Z       ✓ A23: Assignment in paused/inactive lab is rejected with LAB_PAUSED (400) (13 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8547050Z       ✓ GET /api/work/eligible-assignees returns active analytical staff and excludes deactivated staff (8 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8547684Z     5. Staff Directory Scoping & Bounded Pagination (LG-08, LG-22)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8548313Z       ✓ LG-08: National user directory is strictly scoped to labs in authorized country (6 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8549063Z       ✓ LG-08: National user with empty country scope receives empty array (not global leak) (12 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8549808Z       ✓ GET /api/users/directory?purpose=assignment filters to active analytical staff (7 ms)
2026-10-13T13:03:14.8550606Z       ✓ GET /api/users enforces bounded pagination (clamps excessive limit to 100) and excludes password (7 ms)
